OL,5,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FDuring a packed shift, a
OL,7,     F53-year-old chef suffers chest
OL,8,     Fpains, an 84-year-old has had a
OL,9,     Ffall on an escalator, and a
OL,10,     Ffarmer's been crushed by a bull
OL,11,     Ffrom his herd.
OL,12,G2100 A&E After Dark
OL,13,     FA&E staff tackle night shifts,
OL,14,     Fmanaging severe trauma, violence,
OL,15,     Fand complex cases, including a man
OL,16,     Fwith severed fingers, a farmer
OL,17,     Fwith hand injuries, and a possible
OL,18,     Fheart attack.
