OL,5,G2200 Ambulance: Code Red
OL,6,     FA 64-year-old man collapses at
OL,7,     Fwork with a suspected cardiac
OL,8,     Farrest, and paramedics rush to
OL,9,     Fhelp a woman trapped in her car
OL,10,     Fafter crashing into a fallen tree.
OL,11,G2300 Skin A&E
OL,12,     FDr Emma McMullen operates on a
OL,13,     Fstrange pectoral lipoma.
OL,14,     FForty-three-year-old Tamzin visits
OL,15,     FDr Natalia Spierings who's a
OL,16,     Fspecialist in her skin condition,
OL,17,     Fmelasma.
